@startuml
title Features: Authentication & User Provisioning
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
autonumber

actor "User / Admin" as User
participant "Browser (Vue SPA)" as Browser
participant "Laravel (BFF)" as BFF
participant "Microsoft Entra ID" as EntraID
participant "ERP/CRM API" as API
database "PostgreSQL (Local)" as DB

== Feature 1, 2: Login & Just-In-Time Provisioning ==

User -> Browser: Click "Login with Microsoft"
Browser -> BFF: GET /login
BFF -> Browser: Redirect to Entra ID (OIDC)
User -> EntraID: Authenticate
EntraID -> BFF: Callback with Auth Code
BFF -> EntraID: Exchange Code for Access Token
EntraID -> BFF: User Profile (Email, Name, Roles)

BFF -> DB: Check if User Exists locally
alt User Does Not Exist (Nuova utenza nel portale)
    BFF -> DB: Create new User Record (JIT Provisioning)
    BFF -> API: POST /users/sync (Notify ERP of new portal user)
    API -> BFF: 201 Created
end
BFF -> DB: Create Session

== Feature 6, 8: User & Super User Management (Admin) ==

User -> Browser: Access User Management (Admin Role)
Browser -> BFF: GET /admin/users
BFF -> DB: Fetch User List
BFF -> API: GET /erp/users (Sync status)
BFF -> Browser: Display Users

note over User, BFF: Feature 8: Assign Super User for multi-PDV
User -> Browser: Assign "Super User" to Group of PDVs
Browser -> BFF: POST /admin/users/{id}/roles
BFF -> DB: Update local Roles
BFF -> API: POST /users/{id}/pdv-groups (Associate multiple Point of Sales)
API -> BFF: 200 OK
BFF -> Browser: Success Message

@enduml
